			<item><link target="src-packages-app-src-solid-modals-modals-types-ts" link="/src/app/solid/modals/modals.types.ts"><text title="src/app/solid/modals/modals.types.ts" code>modals.types.ts</></>: what <text code>editor.choose()</> takes, and the other dialogs'</>
			<item><link target="src-packages-app-src-solid-modals-dialogs-ts" link="/src/app/solid/modals/dialogs.ts"><text title="src/app/solid/modals/dialogs.ts" code>dialogs.ts</></>: the editor's dialogs, this one among them</>
			<item><link target="src-tests-app-src-solid-modals-modals-browser-test-tsx" link="/tests/app/solid/modals/modals.browser.test.tsx"><text title="tests/app/solid/modals/modals.browser.test.tsx" code>modals.browser.test.tsx</></>: its tests, with the other dialogs'</>
		</>
